    <item>
      <title>是什么导致玛丽亚·巴蒂罗莫在福克斯新闻的垮台</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/05/business/media/maria-bartiromo-fox-news.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[该电视台本周停播了玛丽亚·巴蒂罗莫(Maria Bartiromo)，她是最后一位因报道多米尼恩投票系统(Dominion Voting Systems)而引发昂贵诽谤诉讼的主持人之一。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/05/business/media/maria-bartiromo-fox-news.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 14:31:04 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>普京下令在美国特使访问之前暂停基辅袭击</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/05/world/europe/russia-ukraine-witkoff-kushner-moscow.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[特朗普总统特使史蒂夫·威特科夫和女婿贾里德·库什纳抵达莫斯科与俄罗斯领导人会面。他们接下来前往基辅，努力恢复和平谈判。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/05/world/europe/russia-ukraine-witkoff-kushner-moscow.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 14:24:08 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>普京否认征兵即将到来，但一些俄罗斯人并没有冒险</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/05/world/europe/russia-war-mobilization-draft.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[随着对可能的动员的恐惧成为俄罗斯各地日常生活的一部分，许多人正在决定是逃跑、躲藏还是袖手旁观。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/05/world/europe/russia-war-mobilization-draft.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 12:35:46 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>伊朗官方媒体称美国导弹击中哈格附近的伊朗油轮</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/05/world/middleeast/iran-us-kharg-oil-tanker-attack.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[美国军方尚未证实发生了袭击事件。这些报道发布之前，美国发动了一系列袭击，以报复伊朗袭击船只和美军。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/05/world/middleeast/iran-us-kharg-oil-tanker-attack.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 11:39:55 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>从长远来看，林赛·克兰西会发生什么？</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/05/us/lindsay-clancy-psychiatric-hospital.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[尽管陪审团未能在林赛·克兰西谋杀案审判中做出裁决，但她的未来不太可能获得自由，至少在很长一段时间内是这样。但美国人对于限制她的目的存在分歧。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/05/us/lindsay-clancy-psychiatric-hospital.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 09:04:11 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>伊朗战争给金星家庭带来了什么损失</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/05/us/politics/feehans-iran-war-family.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[第一位是 25 岁的泰勒·詹姆斯·费汉中尉，他被部署到约旦的一个空军基地，当时敌人的导弹和无人机照亮了天空。他是自战争开始以来死亡的 18 名美国人之一。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/05/us/politics/feehans-iran-war-family.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 09:02:53 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>在红色州，注重法律和秩序的共和党人反对集体摄像头</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/05/us/red-states-republicans-flock-cameras.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[德克萨斯州和佛罗里达州州长已采取措施限制车牌阅读器的使用，尽管警方称它们有助于解决犯罪问题。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/05/us/red-states-republicans-flock-cameras.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 09:02:36 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>司法部对福奇和其他病毒科学家的调查内部</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/05/health/fauci-morens-covid-prosecutions.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[由于安东尼·福奇博士面临国会共和党人的公众监督，司法部。已经针对更广泛的研究人员群体进行了更安静、更广泛的努力。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/05/health/fauci-morens-covid-prosecutions.html</guid>
