    <item>
      <title>在重大泄密搜寻中，五角大楼对联合参谋人员进行测谎测试</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/04/us/politics/pentagon-staff-polygraph-tests.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[大约 50 人接受了测试，这是在有关伊朗战争和美军弹药库存减少的新闻报道之后进行的一次前所未有的调查。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/04/us/politics/pentagon-staff-polygraph-tests.html</guid>
