    <item>
      <title>在像林赛·克兰西这样的复杂案件中，很难达成一致裁决</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/04/us/lindsay-clancy-trial-unanimous-verdicts.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[洪氏陪审团并不常见，但林赛·克兰西谋杀案的审判令人痛苦且极其复杂。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/04/us/lindsay-clancy-trial-unanimous-verdicts.html</guid>
